Subject: [PATCH] Settings in sections, saving as you change things

Settings shows one section at a time from a list on the left (General, Recording & import,
Transcription, AI models, Storage & backup, Advanced), with ?section= links; older #profiles,
#backup and #pairing links open the matching section. Every setting saves on its own shortly after
a change, so the Save, Save AI and Save search settings buttons are gone; a status line says Saving,
Saved or Not saved. AI settings appear with the section they belong to (transcription engine and
local pipeline under Transcription, text models, LM Studio and spending under AI models, processing
jobs under Advanced), and API keys with the part that uses them. Auto-transcribe and Auto-summarize
live in Settings only; the Plaud Device page shows their state and links there. General shows the
installed app version. Mobile pairing is on the Android page only.
---
